#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: index.docbook:197
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Currently the only thing you can change about the game look is the color of the lines. To do so use <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on the menubar. See <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> section for details."
